                "op": "mem_changed",
                "at": {
                  "sym": "task_table",
                  "offset": 172
                },
                "len": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "The recorder's entry in the scheduler has been changed, so the task no longer runs the way it was built to. That is a change to a table, not to the code: put the entry back as you found it and patch the task itself."
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "op": "any",
            "of": [
              {
                "op": "mem_changed",
                "at": {
                  "sym": "poll_enable",
